1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,728
This tutorial follows the early termination
from tutorial 48 into the books.

2
00:00:05,728 --> 00:00:09,070
Open Ahmed Hassan's contract for A-101:
with

3
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:11,934
its settlement finalized, it is Closed.

4
00:00:11,934 --> 00:00:15,276
On the Cheques tab, open Journal Vouchers.

5
00:00:15,276 --> 00:00:19,572
Terminating on the thirty-first of August
wrote three things.

6
00:00:19,572 --> 00:00:22,914
The October cheque's PDR is reversed, so

7
00:00:22,914 --> 00:00:26,256
its 21,250 is back on Rent Receivable.

8
00:00:26,256 --> 00:00:31,984
August's recognition is posted again, so
the last month absorbs the rounding.

9
00:00:31,984 --> 00:00:35,326
And TCR-26/2 takes off the unearned rent.

10
00:00:35,326 --> 00:00:36,280
Open it.

11
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:41,054
TCR-26/2 debits Advance Rent and credits
Rent Receivable with 28,410.96:

12
00:00:41,054 --> 00:00:45,828
the rent from September to December, which
was never earned.

13
00:00:45,828 --> 00:00:48,215
Finalizing the settlement wrote STL-26/2.

14
00:00:48,215 --> 00:00:52,511
The deposit of 22,000 is released from
Security Deposit.

15
00:00:52,511 --> 00:00:55,853
Rent Receivable is debited 7,160.96,
clearing what

16
00:00:55,853 --> 00:00:58,717
the landlord owed Ahmed on account.

17
00:00:58,717 --> 00:01:03,491
The cleaning deduction of 750 is credited
to Maintenance Charges.

18
00:01:03,491 --> 00:01:08,742
And the 28,410.96 left is owed to Ahmed,
in Refunds payable.

19
00:01:08,742 --> 00:01:11,129
Paying the refund wrote BPV-26/2.

20
00:01:11,129 --> 00:01:13,993
Refunds payable is debited, and the

21
00:01:13,993 --> 00:01:16,857
building's bank account is credited
28,410.96.

22
00:01:16,857 --> 00:01:21,154
Refunds payable is kept at head office, so
two

23
00:01:21,154 --> 00:01:25,450
inter-property clearing lines balance head
office against the building.

24
00:01:25,450 --> 00:01:29,269
Below the list, the contract account by
account.

25
00:01:29,269 --> 00:01:31,656
Advance Rent is at zero.

26
00:01:31,656 --> 00:01:33,565
The bank keeps 58,839.04.

27
00:01:33,565 --> 00:01:37,384
PDC Receivable and Rent Receivable are at
zero,

28
00:01:37,384 --> 00:01:40,726
and Rental Income shows the 56,589.04
earned.

29
00:01:40,726 --> 00:01:45,022
Security Deposit and Refunds payable are
at zero too.

30
00:01:45,022 --> 00:01:49,796
What the bank keeps is what was earned:
the rent,

31
00:01:49,796 --> 00:01:54,570
the admin fee of 1,500, and the 750 for
cleaning.

32
00:01:54,570 --> 00:01:58,866
Revenue recognition stops at the
termination date: September to

33
00:01:58,866 --> 00:02:02,685
December are cancelled, and the schedule
totals 56,589.04,

34
00:02:02,685 --> 00:02:06,504
the rent earned to the thirty-first of
August.
